  "version": "1.0.0",
  "scheme": "Bcome skills scheme (structured to align with the JSA National Skills Taxonomy when it is published)",
  "notes": [
    "Shaped like the National Skills Taxonomy data model JSA has described: each skill is a SKOS-style concept with a preferred label and a broader grouping, linked to OSCA occupations and to qualifications.",
